seed 301
use binding
register web-2.4 pins 2 edition "2026-10" lease 8d use binding-app

grant
  grant call web-2.4::q to web

as web call web-2.4

as web call web-2.4 2
----

query
  from a in catalog::audit.Call where a.role == "web" select { origin: a.origin, outcome: a.outcome }
----
{ origin: Registered { bundle: "web-2.4", query: 2 }, outcome: Succeeded }

as web call web-2.4 3 error Denied { detail: "role `web` may not make this call" }

query
  from a in catalog::audit.Call where a.role == "web" select { origin: a.origin, outcome: a.outcome }
----
{ origin: Registered { bundle: "web-2.4", query: 2 }, outcome: Succeeded }

query
  from a in catalog::audit.Denied where a.role == "web" select a.origin
----
Registered { bundle: "web-2.4", query: 3 }
